<title>NETHERLANDS: TW.KABEL 1996 NET PROFIT UP 14 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TW.KABEL 1996 NET PROFIT UP 14 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.98 vs   6.17</p>
<p>    Net profit			    54.3  vs  47.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.00 vs   1.64</p>
<p>    Turnover			     773    vs 682</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    82.7  vs  70.8</p>
<p>    Interest gains/loss	   loss 0.3  vs   1.7 gain</p>
<p>    Tax				     28.1  vs  27.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Cable maker NV Twentsche Kabel Holding had previously</p>
<p>said it expected 1996 net to rise by about 10 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
